graph TD
    A[Start: Load Profile] --> B{Profile in Cache?}
    B -->|Yes| C[Load from Cache]
    B -->|No| D[Fetch from Relays]

    C --> E[Display Profile]
    D --> F{Events Found?}
    F -->|Yes| G[Parse Kind 0 Event]
    F -->|No| H[Show Empty Profile]

    G --> I[Cache Profile Data]
    I --> E
    H --> E

    E --> J[Verify NIP-05]
    J --> K{Valid?}
    K -->|Yes| L[Show Verification Badge]
    K -->|No| M[No Badge]

    L --> N[Display Complete Profile]
    M --> N

    N --> O{User Action}
    O -->|Edit| P[Switch to Edit Mode]
    O -->|Follow| Q[Publish Kind 3 Event]
    O -->|Tip| R[Show Lightning Invoice]
    O -->|Share| S[Generate NIP-19 Link]
    O -->|Block/Mute| T[Update Contacts List]

    P --> U[Load Form with Current Data]
    U --> V{User Edits}
    V -->|Save| W[Validate Fields]
    V -->|Cancel| N
    V -->|Preview| X[Show Preview]

    W --> Y{Valid?}
    Y -->|Yes| Z[Create Kind 0 Event]
    Y -->|No| AA[Show Validation Errors]
    AA --> V

    Z --> AB[Sign Event]
    AB --> AC[Publish to Relays]
    AC --> AD{Published?}
    AD -->|Yes| AE[Update Cache]
    AD -->|No| AF[Show Error]

    AE --> AG[Switch to View Mode]
    AF --> V

    X --> V
    AG --> N
    Q --> N
    R --> N
    S --> N
    T --> N

    style A fill:#4F46E5,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    style N fill:#10B981,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    style AC fill:#F59E0B,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px,color:#000
